  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/HeIIyBurton/status/2047424069797101824",
      "reply_text": "Refs and injuries are a recipe for disaster in the playoffs. You can't count on that every time.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:13:13.524881+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Hoopss/status/2047424911480656308",
      "reply_text": "Not sure about Wemby's durability. That's a huge concern for OKC.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:14:01.510196+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/jimrome/status/2047431569267384369",
      "reply_text": "That's Don Nelson for you. Always kept it real.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:14:52.733233+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/CuffsTheLegend/status/2047427771777896511",
      "reply_text": "That's a tough break for OKC. Now it's all about how they adjust their rotation.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:15:43.823182+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/whippy_titan/status/2047426169214267490",
      "reply_text": "Yeah they got cooked. Shai was unstoppable that series.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:16:28.464954+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/DukeMuse/status/2047397006549672123",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, it's a different loyalty system, but it's fair. College hoops first, then the NBA.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:17:04.705737+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/BGNHoops/status/2047423919725170706",
      "reply_text": "Yeah been a sight to watch him shoot like that",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:17:48.257691+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NOLAJake/status/2047407329482617326",
      "reply_text": "No idea, but Bucks do need help at PG. Jenkins would be a solid fit.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:18:35.423496+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PensareBBall/status/2047403358382649621",
      "reply_text": "Not just superstars. Most top players struggle without a strong supporting cast in the playoffs.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:19:15.943044+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Twolves_PR/status/2047440835428368396",
      "reply_text": "That's a tough blow for Edwards. Hope he's back soon.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:29:58.799135+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAdoPovo/status/2047440544805085662",
      "reply_text": "Ankle sprains can be tough to recover from. Hope he's not out long.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:30:41.001367+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBATV/status/2047435344149360653",
      "reply_text": "Game 3 matchups? That's gonna be intense.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:31:31.081673+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/MikeAScotto/status/2047404723863531624",
      "reply_text": "That's a great hire for the Bucks. Giannis trusts him.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:32:15.065683+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/BallersCultureX/status/2047431822574002233",
      "reply_text": "Tough shooting night from 3, but he's got the ability to bounce back. 27% from deep isn't his norm.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:32:49.553367+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Spurs_Latam/status/2047415763468751198",
      "reply_text": "Fair, no official word yet. Guess we'll have to wait for the report.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:33:38.522675+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/IKE_Bucks/status/2047415752374800590",
      "reply_text": "Big shoes to fill. Hope he can get Giannis back to his MVP form.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:34:32.896999+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ramonashelburne/status/2047443420587917717",
      "reply_text": "Questionable's a big step up from out. Hope he's good to go.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:45:27.661066+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/DebatesOnNBA/status/2047401504101835209",
      "reply_text": "Both were beasts, but Curry's quicks made him harder to stay in front of.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:46:12.105959+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/DubsVault/status/2047428549481812319",
      "reply_text": "Still clutch, still shooting like that",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:46:49.247601+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/reha37/status/2047409117090730413",
      "reply_text": "Yeah that's the mark of a generational talent. No one's surprised when he makes shots anymore.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:47:40.445355+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SaintsLeadSM/status/2047421204462448771",
      "reply_text": "DJM's return definitely changed their trajectory. He's been crucial for them lately.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:48:21.252580+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/LakersOnX/status/2047436795860623397",
      "reply_text": "Questionable for Game 3. That's a big deal for the Lakers' rotation.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:59:05.346169+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/lukeevangelist_/status/2047420979853291823",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, his speed and aggression would be great assets. But let's see how he handles the physicality of the Bucky Ball league.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T23:59:58.425501+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/spacecitybr/status/2047437820847960134",
      "reply_text": "Big for the Lakers if they can get him back. His shooting matters.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-24T00:00:54.283063+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Randmnbapost/status/2047436689950347512",
      "reply_text": "That west is wild, indeed. Lakers' bench depth is a concern with Jdub out.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-24T00:01:39.684995+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/RunItBackFDTV/status/2047409170832379979",
      "reply_text": "Yeah that's a regular season take. Playoffs he's getting trapped",
